  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-03-05T02:06:33.366Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, I believe only the physcolliders on hands will be able to interact with other players.\nSome avatars have a constrained rig where the avatars' hands do not line up with the rig hands.\nAdjusting the collider positions in the avatar descriptor is not enough to compensate for this.\nAs such it's not possible for avatars with constrained arms to interact with other people properly, since only the hand colliders in the avatar descriptor will be added to the global PhysicsCollders list.\nI'd suggest to add a transform override option to the descriptor under Custom for each collider to change the attachment location of generated colliders.",
